# NeoDCT network interfaces.
#
# Replaces the file buildroot generates from BR2_SYSTEM_DHCP, which marked
# eth0 "auto" with a 15 second wait-delay. The phone has no ethernet: the
# Luckfox DTS disables gmac, and QEMU only gets a NIC when run_qemu.sh is
# given NEODCT_NET=1. So every boot spent 15 seconds waiting for an
# interface that would never appear, then failed:
#
#   Starting network: Waiting for interface eth0 to appear....... timeout!
#
# Data comes from the modem instead (S45modem brings up the qmi_wwan
# interface), so nothing here should block boot.

auto lo
iface lo inet loopback

# Deliberately not "auto": defined so `ifup eth0` works when a NIC really
# is attached (NEODCT_NET=1 for browser testing), without boot waiting on it.
iface eth0 inet dhcp
